# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.
#
# We DO NOT proxy /api/solstice externally here. Cloudflare Pages
# compiles external-URL rewrites into a synthetic Pages Function under
# the hood, and that pipeline currently fails with
#   "Failed to publish your Function. Got error: Unknown internal error"
# on monorepo deploys (no functions dir, just an external rewrite in
# _redirects). The Solstice proxy now lives in the backend-edge Worker
# at `/solstice` — set VITE_EDGE_URL in the Pages dashboard so the
# frontend calls `${VITE_EDGE_URL}/solstice` instead. See
# `packages/backend-edge/src/index.ts` and
# `packages/frontend-institutional/src/lib/lib/solsticeApi.ts`.

# SPA fallback — every unknown path serves index.html so client-side
# refresh-mid-route works. Vite's hashed /assets/<hash>.{js,css}
# filenames mean this won't shadow real assets.
/*  /index.html  200
